Comment: 0,0:00:01.86,0:00:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理是...
Comment: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.06,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,人造物!?
Comment: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是說...
Comment: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,人工製造出的人類...嗎?
Comment: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒錯
Comment: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼...怎麼可能!
Comment: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳會這麼驚訝也是正常的
Comment: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,從常識面來說 是無法接受的事情
Comment: 0,0:00:23.65,0:00:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 人們有時候會企圖超越常識
Comment: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果是妳 應該可以理解的啊
Comment: 0,0:00:35.26,0:00:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,透過解析構成那孩子身體的蛋白質
Comment: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發現那是不存在於自然界中的東西
Comment: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是本人似乎沒有自覺到自己和一般人不同
Comment: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當然 光看外表也無法辨別出來
Comment: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且她的身體機能和人類比起來絲毫不遜色
Comment: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 問題在於...
Comment: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那孩子每進行一次新陳代謝
Comment: 0,0:01:06.14,0:01:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,體內就會產生一定份量的毒素
Comment: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,毒?
Comment: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒錯 如果放任毒素累積在體內
Comment: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,引起內臟的機能不全
Comment: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就會邁向死亡
Comment: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那孩子...
Comment: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是現在很有精神...
Comment: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是因為那糖果
Comment: 0,0:01:24.46,0:01:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸?
Comment: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那糖果含有能中和毒素的成份
Comment: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以說那孩子的性命就是靠著那個糖果來延續的
Comment: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是說如果不持續吃那個糖果
Comment: 0,0:01:35.41,0:01:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就無法存活下去嗎...?
Comment: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼會變成這樣
Comment: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原因仍不明
Comment: 0,0:01:41.63,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是技術上的問題
Comment: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,或是有意圖的讓她這樣
Comment: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管是什麼
Comment: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要讓那孩子的身體維持在正常狀態
Comment: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只有...
Comment: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,製造出那孩子的人們才有辦法做到吧
Comment: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是誰...
Comment: 0,0:01:57.25,0:01:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是誰製造出菲布理...
Comment: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是為了什麼?
Comment: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,難道是這城市的高層
Comment: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又開始了什麼白痴的實驗!?
Comment: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在幾年前有聽說過
Comment: 0,0:02:09.57,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,運用科學製造人類的研究有了進展
Comment: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不知何時這個傳言消失了...
Comment: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼...菲布理是在那個研究中所誕生的...
Comment: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當時
Comment: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在那個研究中
Comment: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,暗部也有參與
Comment: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,暗部?
Comment: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在學園都市中
Comment: 0,0:02:30.49,0:02:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有幾個組織 鮮少人知道他們的存在
Comment: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是連警備員都無法干涉的黑暗組織
Comment: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:36.97,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(715,980)}Anti-skill
Comment: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我可是在暗部工作的啊
Comment: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳以為憑妳這種程度的小孩打架
Comment: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就能解決這座城市裡的「黑暗」嗎?
Comment: 0,0:02:46.34,0:02:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果妳想拯救那孩子的話
Comment: 0,0:02:49.45,0:02:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就要做好面對黑暗的覺悟
Comment: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳有這種覺悟嗎?
Comment: 0,0:02:58.03,0:02:59.28,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:30.24,Default,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,呱呱呱~
Comment: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是呱太唷~
Comment: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,呱呱呱~
Comment: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂 醫生說了什麼?
Comment: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊...沒什麼...
Comment: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,醫生說已經沒什麼大礙 可以回去了
Comment: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.43,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,太好了
Comment: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理 我們回家吧
Comment: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一起嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嗯 初春也一起喔
Comment: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 也許回宿舍的路上又會被襲擊呢...
Comment: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳說的沒錯
Comment: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我聯絡警備員 請他們加強巡邏
Comment: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:03.47,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(825,980)}Anti-skill
Comment: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嗯 就這麼辦
Comment: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一下就到了早上呢
Comment: 0,0:05:10.23,0:05:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理肚子會不會餓?
Comment: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,漢堡肉!
Comment: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳這麼喜歡吃啊
Comment: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以喔
Comment: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人 妳怎麼了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳剛剛和醫生說完話回來後
Comment: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,臉色就一直不太好呢
Comment: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是...是這樣嗎...
Comment: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,貓咪?
Comment: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼會跑到這裡?
Comment: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了?
Comment: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊...沒有...那個...
Comment: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我有事情忘了問醫生
Comment: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我去問完就回來
Comment: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以 妳們先走吧
Comment: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人?
Comment: 0,0:05:58.01,0:05:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好久不見
Comment: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說妳擅自跑出來沒問題嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有得到了醫生的許可
Comment: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有問題
Comment: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂說明道
Comment: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊...
Comment: 0,0:06:10.46,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣就好
Comment: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,昨晚 我和那個少女說過話了
Comment: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,少女...
Comment: 0,0:06:18.07,0:06:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是指菲布理嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我看見姐姐大人徹夜在外等待她治療完成
Comment: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明我身為妳的妹妹
Comment: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,卻好久沒有來看我...
Comment: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 等...
Comment: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,覺得那位少女對妳而言一定很重要
Comment: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂鬧彆扭似地撇開頭
Comment: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,散發出陰沉的氣息
Comment: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,並...並不是說妳們誰比較重要才...
Comment: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以才在深夜
Comment: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到她的病房裡看了看
Comment: 0,0:06:51.05,0:06:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,恢復意識了呢
Comment: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,美琴?
Comment: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不 我是她妹妹
Comment: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,正確來說
Comment: 0,0:06:58.45,0:07:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是用姐姐大人的DNA圖譜所製造出的複製人
Comment: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂自我介紹道
Comment: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妹妹...
Comment: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,美琴是妳的姐姐嗎?
Comment: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然是讓人非常頭痛的姐姐
Comment: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理也有姐姐喔
Comment: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好想見她喔...
Comment: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理有姐姐?
Comment: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,人工製造出的菲布理卻有姐姐...
Comment: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是怎麼回事?
Comment: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,難道那個姐姐也和菲布理一樣...
Comment: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和她交談後 還發現了一件事情
Comment: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂附加說道
Comment: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我發現她所擁有的知識
Comment: 0,0:07:37.13,0:07:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有一定模式的偏差
Comment: 0,0:07:42.45,0:07:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼意思?
Comment: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這和御坂經歷過的
Comment: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,經由學習裝置進行學習過程中的初期狀態很相似
Comment: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:50.29,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(565,980)}Testament
Comment: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂報告道
Comment: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她可能是使用學習裝置獲得知識的吧
Comment: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:59.87,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(961,980)}Testament
Comment: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且 從模式的類似性來思考
Comment: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,開發她所使用的學習裝置程式的人
Comment: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:07.32,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1054,980)}Testament
Comment: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,與御坂那時的開發者是同一個人的可能性很高
Comment: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂陳述著推測
Comment: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那不就是...
Comment: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個死魚眼?
Comment: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,從那之後就沒見過她...
Comment: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個女的和菲布理有關!?
Comment: 0,0:08:23.05,0:08:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又參與了這種計畫...
Comment: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...
Comment: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個人
Comment: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她讓御坂知道了奶茶的味道
Comment: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果可以的話
Comment: 0,0:08:38.59,0:08:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想再見她一面
Comment: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想向她道謝
Comment: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂說出了自己渺小的願望
Comment: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,先不管那傢伙是否參與了菲布理的事件
Comment: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,據婚后所說
Comment: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那些襲擊我們的傢伙說「要回收菲布理」
Comment: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是說
Comment: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「要拿回去」
Comment: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理是從那些傢伙那邊逃出來的?
Comment: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管怎樣
Comment: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,查出對方的真實身分後直接問他們
Comment: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是最快的方法了
Comment: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果真的和暗部相關...
Comment: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不能把黑子和大家捲入
Comment: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我一個人來解決...
Comment: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是
Comment: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了嗎? 婚后
Comment: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼怎麼了
Comment: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我非常擔心菲布理之後的狀況
Comment: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去醫院詢問卻說已經出院了...
Comment: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱歉...
Comment: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,已經痊癒了
Comment: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛剛出院而已
Comment: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,食慾很好 總之不用擔心了
Comment: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是太好了
Comment: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會轉達給灣內和泡浮知道的
Comment: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麻煩妳了
Comment: 0,0:10:03.53,0:10:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說我做了很對不起她們兩人的事情...
Comment: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和她們說了昨天的事件後
Comment: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們非常自責當時不在現場
Comment: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說「無論是開心還是害怕都要共同分擔才是真正的朋友」
Comment: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,的確...
Comment: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果換成我站在她們的立場
Comment: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一定也會自責自己沒能幫上忙
Comment: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我居然讓她們有這種想法...
Comment: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,友情還真是深奧啊!
Comment: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是啊
Comment: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再見 幫我和灣內及泡浮問好
Comment: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,事情辦完了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 一起回去吧
Comment: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然決定要一個人行動
Comment: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就必須提高效率
Comment: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,首先去各個資料庫找資料 尋找線索
Comment: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「無論是開心還是害怕都要共同分擔才是真正的朋友」
Comment: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人 妳要出門嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有點雜事...
Comment: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大概傍晚左右回來
Comment: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再見
Comment: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請路上小心
Comment: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果...那些雜事需要人幫忙的話
Comment: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,隨時都可以和我說喔
Comment: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子我...
Comment: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會永遠在這裡
Comment: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人?
Comment: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我真是太沒長進了
Comment: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...姐姐大...
Comment: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,決定了!
Comment: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子啊
Comment: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我有事要和妳說
Comment: 0,0:12:25.58,0:12:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好的!
Comment: 0,0:12:26.13,0:12:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等...等等 浴巾!浴巾啦!
Comment: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂...佐天
Comment: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱歉抱歉
Comment: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但...但是 菲布理她...
Comment: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是人工製造出來的...
Comment: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果沒有那糖果就活不下去...
Comment: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是製造出菲布理的人故意設計成這樣的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大概是...
Comment: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,連警備員也無法干涉...
Comment: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:52.01,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(807,980)}Anti-skill
Comment: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的有這種組織嗎?
Comment: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我覺得有...
Comment: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,已經有線索了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然不確定...
Comment: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我曾經遇過一個類似的組織
Comment: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是些非常可怕的危險人物
Comment: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要拯救菲布理的話
Comment: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就意味著要踏入這個危險的領域
Comment: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這點我希望妳們能了解
Comment: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然不想讓妳們遭遇危險
Comment: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說實話 我也不知道我能保護到多少...
Comment: 0,0:13:27.67,0:13:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,即使這樣 妳們還想要幫忙的話...
Comment: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,首先
Comment: 0,0:13:30.88,0:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一定要先找出製造菲布理的人呢
Comment: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我記得婚后曾經看到過對方的臉吧?
Comment: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對啊
Comment: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,向她說明情況 請她協助我們吧
Comment: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還要去昨天傍晚被襲擊的地方
Comment: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看看周遭有沒有什麼線索
Comment: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當時監視攝影機沒有運作
Comment: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,很有可能是被動了手腳
Comment: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我去調查看看系統有沒有被入侵的痕跡
Comment: 0,0:13:53.21,0:13:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有 只要有那個糖果
Comment: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理就能維持健康吧
Comment: 0,0:13:57.43,0:13:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們能不能自己做出來呢
Comment: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳說的沒錯呢
Comment: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這方面的調查 就拜託佐天了
Comment: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有上次的搭載型機器人事件
Comment: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我去確認一下警備員有沒有發現什麼線索
Comment: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:10.74,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(867,980)}Anti-skill
Comment: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就這麼辦
Comment: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有啊...
Comment: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們...
Comment: 0,0:14:15.09,0:14:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂怎麼了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂也加入討論啦
Comment: 0,0:14:18.89,0:14:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在對方發動攻擊前先發制人才是上策啊
Comment: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:29.01,下一回,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:31.51,下一回,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理 妳在畫什麼?
Comment: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,呱太!
Comment: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哇~~~畫得很棒呢
Comment: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再來要畫美偉喔!
Comment: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的嗎?
