Comment: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算沒有...
Comment: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我再問妳一次
Comment: 0,0:22:18.11,0:22:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳有面對這個城市的黑暗的覺悟嗎?
Comment: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,即使是要由妳自己 來承受這份痛楚
Comment: 0,0:22:28.94,0:22:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果是為了拯救菲布理...
Comment: 0,0:22:34.46,0:22:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,暗部的事情
Comment: 0,0:22:35.97,0:22:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去問了解這方面的人是最快的途徑
Comment: 0,0:22:40.17,0:22:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果妳希望的話
Comment: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我讓妳們見面吧
Comment: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會先和那邊說好
Comment: 0,0:22:57.64,0:22:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對方是...
Comment: 0,0:22:59.47,0:23:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳也很熟悉的人
Comment: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是好久不見啊
Comment: 0,0:23:09.73,0:23:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,實驗動物小姐
Comment: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:31.26,Default,Next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:31.19,0:23:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好久不見啦 實驗動物
Comment: 0,0:23:33.89,0:23:34.49,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,妳是...
Comment: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是我
Comment: 0,0:23:35.45,0:23:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個時候的...
Comment: 0,0:23:36.27,0:23:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒錯
Comment: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是誰來著...
Comment: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,泰瑞絲緹娜啦!
Comment: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:48.02,Default,thanks,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:39.96,0:23:47.96,Default,export,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:29.01,ADT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs100\pos(461,581)}黑\N暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:40.02,下一回,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs80\pos(150,539)}STUDY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.86,0:00:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.06,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}人造物!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也就是說...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}人工製造出的人類...嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼...怎麼可能!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳會這麼驚訝也是正常的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}從常識面來說 是無法接受的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.65,0:00:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是 人們有時候會企圖超越常識
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果是妳 應該可以理解的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.26,0:00:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}透過解析構成那孩子身體的蛋白質
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}發現那是不存在於自然界中的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是本人似乎沒有自覺到自己和一般人不同
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}當然 光看外表也無法辨別出來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且她的身體機能和人類比起來絲毫不遜色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是 問題在於...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那孩子每進行一次新陳代謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.14,0:01:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}體內就會產生一定份量的毒素
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}毒?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒錯 如果放任毒素累積在體內
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}引起內臟的機能不全
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就會邁向死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那孩子...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是現在很有精神...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是因為那糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.46,0:01:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那糖果含有能中和毒素的成份
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以說那孩子的性命就是靠著那個糖果來延續的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也就是說如果不持續吃那個糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.41,0:01:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就無法存活下去嗎...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.11,0:01:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原因仍不明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.63,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是技術上的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}或是有意圖的讓她這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要讓那孩子的身體維持在正常狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只有...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}製造出那孩子的人們才有辦法做到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是誰...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:01:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是誰製造出菲布理...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是為了什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}難道是這城市的高層
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又開始了什麼白痴的實驗!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在幾年前有聽說過
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.57,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}運用科學製造人類的研究有了進展
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不知何時這個傳言消失了...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼...菲布理是在那個研究中所誕生的...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}當時
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在那個研究中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}暗部也有參與
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}暗部?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在學園都市中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.49,0:02:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有幾個組織 鮮少人知道他們的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是連警備員都無法干涉的黑暗組織
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:36.97,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(715,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我可是在暗部工作的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳以為憑妳這種程度的小孩打架
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就能解決這座城市裡的「黑暗」嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.34,0:02:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果妳想拯救那孩子的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.45,0:02:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就要做好面對黑暗的覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳有這種覺悟嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}呱呱呱~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是呱太唷~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}呱呱呱~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂 醫生說了什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊...沒什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}醫生說已經沒什麼大礙 可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.43,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理 我們回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一起嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}嗯 初春也一起喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是 也許回宿舍的路上又會被襲擊呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我聯絡警備員 請他們加強巡邏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:03.47,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(825,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}嗯 就這麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一下就到了早上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.23,0:05:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理肚子會不會餓?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}漢堡肉!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳這麼喜歡吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人 妳怎麼了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳剛剛和醫生說完話回來後
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}臉色就一直不太好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是...是這樣嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}貓咪?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼會跑到這裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊...沒有...那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我有事情忘了問醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我去問完就回來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以 妳們先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:05:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說妳擅自跑出來沒問題嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有得到了醫生的許可
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂說明道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.46,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣就好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}昨晚 我和那個少女說過話了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}少女...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.07,0:06:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是指菲布理嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我看見姐姐大人徹夜在外等待她治療完成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明我身為妳的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}卻好久沒有來看我...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂 等...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}覺得那位少女對妳而言一定很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂鬧彆扭似地撇開頭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}散發出陰沉的氣息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}並...並不是說妳們誰比較重要才...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以才在深夜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}到她的病房裡看了看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.05,0:06:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}恢復意識了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}美琴?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不 我是她妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}正確來說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.45,0:07:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是用姐姐大人的DNA圖譜所製造出的複製人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂自我介紹道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妹妹...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}美琴是妳的姐姐嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然是讓人非常頭痛的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理也有姐姐喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好想見她喔...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理有姐姐?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}人工製造出的菲布理卻有姐姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是怎麼回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}難道那個姐姐也和菲布理一樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和她交談後 還發現了一件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂附加說道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我發現她所擁有的知識
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.13,0:07:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有一定模式的偏差
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.45,0:07:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這和御坂經歷過的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}經由學習裝置進行學習過程中的初期狀態很相似
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:50.29,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(565,980)}Testament
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂報告道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她可能是使用學習裝置獲得知識的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:59.87,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(961,980)}Testament
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且 從模式的類似性來思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}開發她所使用的學習裝置程式的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:07.32,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1054,980)}Testament
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}與御坂那時的開發者是同一個人的可能性很高
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂陳述著推測
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那不就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個死魚眼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}從那之後就沒見過她...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個女的和菲布理有關!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.05,0:08:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又參與了這種計畫...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她讓御坂知道了奶茶的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果可以的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.59,0:08:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想再見她一面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想向她道謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂說出了自己渺小的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}先不管那傢伙是否參與了菲布理的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}據婚后所說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那些襲擊我們的傢伙說「要回收菲布理」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「要拿回去」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理是從那些傢伙那邊逃出來的?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}查出對方的真實身分後直接問他們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是最快的方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果真的和暗部相關...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不能把黑子和大家捲入
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我一個人來解決...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了嗎? 婚后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我非常擔心菲布理之後的狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}去醫院詢問卻說已經出院了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}已經痊癒了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛剛出院而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}食慾很好 總之不用擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會轉達給灣內和泡浮知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麻煩妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.53,0:10:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說我做了很對不起她們兩人的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和她們說了昨天的事件後
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們非常自責當時不在現場
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說「無論是開心還是害怕都要共同分擔才是真正的朋友」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}的確...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果換成我站在她們的立場
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一定也會自責自己沒能幫上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我居然讓她們有這種想法...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}友情還真是深奧啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再見 幫我和灣內及泡浮問好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}事情辦完了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼 一起回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然決定要一個人行動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就必須提高效率
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}首先去各個資料庫找資料 尋找線索
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「無論是開心還是害怕都要共同分擔才是真正的朋友」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人 妳要出門嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有點雜事...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大概傍晚左右回來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果...那些雜事需要人幫忙的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}隨時都可以和我說喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子我...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會永遠在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我真是太沒長進了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...姐姐大...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}決定了!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我有事要和妳說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.58,0:12:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好的!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.13,0:12:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等...等等 浴巾!浴巾啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂...佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但...但是 菲布理她...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是人工製造出來的...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果沒有那糖果就活不下去...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是製造出菲布理的人故意設計成這樣的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大概是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}連警備員也無法干涉...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:52.01,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(807,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的有這種組織嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我覺得有...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}已經有線索了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然不確定...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我曾經遇過一個類似的組織
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都是些非常可怕的危險人物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要拯救菲布理的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就意味著要踏入這個危險的領域
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這點我希望妳們能了解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然不想讓妳們遭遇危險
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說實話 我也不知道我能保護到多少...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.67,0:13:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}即使這樣 妳們還想要幫忙的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}首先
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.88,0:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一定要先找出製造菲布理的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我記得婚后曾經看到過對方的臉吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}向她說明情況 請她協助我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還要去昨天傍晚被襲擊的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看看周遭有沒有什麼線索
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}當時監視攝影機沒有運作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很有可能是被動了手腳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我去調查看看系統有沒有被入侵的痕跡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.21,0:13:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有 只要有那個糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理就能維持健康吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.43,0:13:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們能不能自己做出來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳說的沒錯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這方面的調查 就拜託佐天了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有上次的搭載型機器人事件
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我去確認一下警備員有沒有發現什麼線索
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:10.74,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(867,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就這麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳們...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.09,0:14:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂怎麼了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂也加入討論啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.89,0:14:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在對方發動攻擊前先發制人才是上策啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理 妳在畫什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}呱太!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哇~~~畫得很棒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再來要畫美偉喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不好意思 固法學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.81,0:14:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拜託妳照顧菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.15,0:14:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說 怎麼樣了?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有找到什麼線索嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.05,0:14:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看起來並沒有留下入侵監視器的痕跡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我再擴大搜索範圍試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}畫好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我看我看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:11.22,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我回來了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.43,0:15:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}佐天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.05,0:15:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}糖果的事情有什麼發現嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有...那個啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要解析糖果的所有成份是很困難的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.89,0:15:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算解析出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要製造出那種糖果是更困難的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}醫生這麼說...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然他說有什麼新發現就會連絡我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.83,0:15:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}總覺得那個醫生不太可靠啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有一張和呱太一樣的臉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:15:43.26,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}淚子好好玩~~!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:15:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}佐...佐天...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個搭載型機器人?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的 有些事情想要確認一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱歉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個已經不在這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個事件決定由總部進行調查
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今天早上就把所有物證都拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有那個警備機器人也被拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}警備機器人是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是在學究會的會場暴走的那個?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}總部的蠻橫不講理也不是一天兩天的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過這次的動作還真快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能調查的範圍我都查了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是幾乎沒什麼成果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}零件全都沒有註冊過
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}從足跡著手也沒查出線索
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒辦法了呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再見
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個 拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是掉在搭載型機器人裡面的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說不定藏有什麼線索
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以給我們嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}反正都會被總部拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:17:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對我來說 交給妳們也是一樣的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不准亂來喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是什麼的零件嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}物證全部被拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我想恐怕是有人向警備員施壓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:21.67,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1140,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是御坂所說的黑暗組織嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該是吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼事情都好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.93,0:17:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}之後妳有回想起什麼事情嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}監視器方面怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.31,0:17:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個時候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.53,0:17:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那附近一帶的監視器都發生了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸? 其他的監視器也...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只能認為那個區域全部的監視器都受到了某種干擾...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這麼說來 那個時候手機也沒有訊號呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無法當作是巧合呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有...那天在稍微有點距離的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又發生了信號故障
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}信號故障 是像之前那樣子的...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和那個也有關係嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然無法確定...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.45,0:18:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}若僅僅針對菲布理 也太大費周章了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}難道是有什麼其他的目的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我跟蹤了前幾天看到的那個男人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.09,0:18:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但還是沒有發現什麼線索
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.41,0:18:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我知道了 謝謝妳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會再擴大範圍搜索看看的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}別太勉強喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有 關於那個搭載型機器人 有什麼發現嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然警備員有調查
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:47.29,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(930,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但似乎沒什麼發現
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我這邊也去調查看看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我父親的公司中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有一個學園都市的搭載型機器人共同研究部門
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很有幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再見 之後再聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是婚后嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說會繼續搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說為什麼那個男人會在學究會的會場呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是追著菲布理來的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們也不能輸給婚后光子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再一次徹底調查所有線索吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我來調查這幾天學園都市內發生的停電
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼我去調查和菲布理第一次見面的地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂美琴?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.85,0:19:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理為什麼會知道我的名字?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.01,0:19:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是誰告訴過她...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是誰...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是那傢伙!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...若是這樣...為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}警備員那方面我已經做好安排了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:54.41,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(628,980)}Anti-skill
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然我不認為他們能查出什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過 防範於未然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.23,0:20:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}重要的學究會就要來臨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要是他們到處調查搜尋會很麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管菲布理真的沒問題嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這件事我們昨天達成了決議吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只是確認一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.86,0:20:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我可不想讓我們華麗的舞台沾上汙點呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.29,0:20:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理在學究會開始前一定會死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}反正就只是個備胎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}根本不會有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}學究會就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在應該把重點放在調整上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}準備應該萬無一失了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.61,0:20:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那當然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳說對吧 布束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.49,0:20:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}My utmost
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會盡力做到最好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個死魚眼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然被長點上機學園退學了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.65,0:20:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}之後就行蹤成謎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這麼一來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剩下的線索就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個容器裡所裝的纖維狀物品
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和構成菲布理那孩子的身體物質
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是同一種成份
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}簡單來說就是頭髮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.43,0:21:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}頭髮?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼...菲布理的...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是其他個體的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}其他個體...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.27,0:21:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}菲布理的姐姐...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也有些事情要和妳說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我針對那個糖果做了詳細的調查
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}從她身上攜帶的數量來看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}情況比我們想像的還要緊迫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}緊迫?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.17,0:21:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}約72小時
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現有的糖果所能維持的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.13,0:21:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她所剩餘的存活時間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.19,0:21:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼會...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.13,0:21:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不能想想辦法嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.99,0:21:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如同我先前說的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.63,0:21:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果說有人能治好那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:21:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只有製造出她的人才能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.01,0:22:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳要去哪裡呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.53,0:22:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}去哪裡...當然是去找人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.77,0:22:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}現在馬上 和大家一起把製造出菲布理的傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.63,0:22:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有鎖定目標了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算沒有...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我再問妳一次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.11,0:22:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳有面對這個城市的黑暗的覺悟嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}即使是要由妳自己 來承受這份痛楚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.94,0:22:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果是為了拯救菲布理...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.46,0:22:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}暗部的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.97,0:22:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}去問了解這方面的人是最快的途徑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.17,0:22:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果妳希望的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我讓妳們見面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會先和那邊說好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.64,0:22:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對方是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.47,0:23:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳也很熟悉的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是好久不見啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.73,0:23:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}實驗動物小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.19,0:23:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好久不見啦 實驗動物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.89,0:23:34.49,Default,s,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.45,0:23:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個時候的...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.27,0:23:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是誰來著...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}泰瑞絲緹娜啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:06.33,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}璀璨的希望終會穿越這座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:12.75,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}與永遠相互信任的同伴手牽著手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:19.80,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}隨著心兒  繼續尋找所相信的明天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:27.72,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}佇立在人群中 注視著你遠去的背影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:34.27,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}漸漸理解「甘苦共享」的重要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:41.03,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}幾份笑容如今依舊點染炫彩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:49.25,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}就是想要守護這份繚繞著大家的平常
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:55.79,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}若讓伊始的夢想響徹蒼穹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:04:02.34,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}堅定不移的能力便會捉住現實
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:09.18,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}因為擁有承認軟弱的那份堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:15.73,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}為了永記心間  唯獨抱緊這份情誼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:22.40,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5}挺起胸膛  衝破足以自豪的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.65,0:23:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
